| Feature                     | Meaning                                                      | Example                                               |
| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| **Conversation History**    | Stores all previous messages                                 | "Show Chennai news" → "Summarize it"                  |
| **Session Memory**          | Remembers important information during the current chat      | "My name is Sugumar." → "What is my name?"            |
| **Context-Aware Prompting** | Uses previous conversation when sending the prompt to the AI | "Translate it" → AI knows "it" means the Chennai news |


=============

Conversation History

Conversation History is the record of previous messages exchanged between the user and the AI during a conversation.

Session Memory

Session Memory temporarily stores user information and conversation data during the current chat session.

Context-Aware Prompting

Context-Aware Prompting includes relevant previous conversation in the prompt so the AI can generate accurate and contextually relevant responses.

===============

📜 Conversation History = What we talked about
🧠 Session Memory = What the AI remembers in this chat
💬 Context-Aware Prompting = Using that memory to answer correctly

================
